Answer: Execution begins from the main() method.

```java
public static void main(String[] args) {
// program logic
}
```

Answer: ```java
class Demo {
public static void main(String[] args) {
System.out.println("Namaste Karnataka");
}
}
```

Output: Namaste Karnataka

Answer: The source-file name is kept the same as the class name containing the main() method. For example:

```java
class Demo {
public static void main(String[] args) {
}
}
```

is saved as: Demo.java
